  "Info": {
    "Name": "Scribble Light",
    "Version": 1.1,
    "Author": "Duong Dieu Phap",
    "Description": "Scribble Light uses black ink on cool white paper, with cherry-red pencil marks and touches of violet. The icons have uneven contours, loose shading, and a few hatch marks, like drawings in the margin of a notebook. Its handwritten \"ig\" logo sits on a dark ink tile, with a red dot to match the controls."
  },
